# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INTEGRITY VERIFICATION PROTOCOL
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. At build time:
#    - Models are downloaded from verified sources
#    - SHA-256 computed and compared to this file
#    - Mismatch = build failure
#
# 2. At runtime:
#    - Before loading any model, verify hash
#    - Mismatch = refuse to load, alert user
#    - No fallback to unverified models
#
# 3. Update procedure:
#    - New model hashes must be signed with GENESIS_KEY
#    - Signature published to IPFS
#    - Binary includes expected hash of this file
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model Sources (for reproducibility):
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# text-embedding: HuggingFace sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
# sentiment: Custom fine-tuned on Omniverse feedback data
# intent: Custom trained on Phoenix interaction logs
# ner: spaCy en_core_web_sm converted to ONNX
# activity-predictor: Custom trained on WHOOP/Oura data
# ranker: Custom trained on user engagement metrics
